OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785511094
OL,3,CAppeal to find brutal murderer 40
OL,4,Cyears after crime
OL,6,FDetectives are appealing for help to
OL,7,Ffind the real killer of a woman
OL,8,Fbrutally murdered 40 years ago after
OL,9,Fthe wrong man spent 38 years in prison.
OL,11,FDiane Sindall, was just 21 when she
OL,12,Fwas attacked and killed while walking
OL,13,Fthrough Birkenhead in the early hours
OL,14,Fof 2 August 1986.
OL,16,FShe had been sexually assaulted and
OL,17,Fsuffered extensive injuries, with her
OL,18,Fbody found hours later in an alleyway
OL,19,Foff Borough Road.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
