FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785511094
OL,3,CAppeal to find brutal murderer 40
OL,4,Cyears after crime
OL,6,FFor decades, Merseyside Police thought
OL,7,Fit had caught her killer, local man
OL,8,FPeter Sullivan, who was then aged 30.
OL,10,FMr Sullivan was given a life sentence
OL,11,Ffor Diane's murder, but he always
OL,12,Fmaintained his innocence.
OL,14,FAdvances in forensic science saw the
OL,15,Fcase reopened in 2023, after new DNA
OL,16,Fevidence confirmed that the profile
OL,17,Fdid not match the man previously
OL,18,Fconvicted of her murder.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785511094
OL,3,CAppeal to find brutal murderer 40
OL,4,Cyears after crime
OL,6,FIn May 2025, he was released from jail
OL,7,Fafter 38 years, after new tests showed
OL,8,Fhis DNA was not present in semen
OL,9,Fsamples collected at the scene.
OL,11,FSince then, officers have worked with
OL,12,Fthe National Crime Agency to try and
OL,13,Fidentify the person the DNA belongs
OL,14,Fto, and the investigation remains
OL,15,Fongoing.
OL,17,FA Crimestoppers reward of up to
OL,18,F#20,000 is still available for
OL,19,Finformation given exclusively to the
OL,20,Fcharity that leads to the arrest and
OL,21,Fconviction of Diane's killer.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785511094
OL,3,CAppeal to find brutal murderer 40
OL,4,Cyears after crime
OL,6,FDetective Superintendent Rachel Wilson
OL,7,Fsaid: "It's unthinkable that 40 years
OL,8,Fon from Diane's murder her killer has
OL,9,Fstill not been brought to justice, but
OL,10,FI want her family, friends and the
OL,11,Fwider public to be reassured that we
OL,12,Fare doing everything in our power to
OL,13,Ffind that person.
OL,15,F"We have a dedicated investigation
OL,16,Fteam who have been painstakingly
OL,17,Freviewing the original investigation,
OL,18,Fre-interviewing witnesses, carrying
OL,19,Fout DNA tests and following up new
OL,20,Finformation submitted by the public.
OL,26,@oD@GOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785511094
OL,3,CAppeal to find brutal murderer 40
OL,4,Cyears after crime
OL,6,F"We remain determined that Diane's
OL,7,Ffamily get the answers they have
OL,8,Fwaited so long for and that we get
OL,9,Fjustice for Diane.
OL,11,F"Forty years is a long time, but it is
OL,12,Fnever too late for someone to do the
OL,13,Fright thing and come forward with any
OL,14,Finformation they have which may help
OL,15,Fto assist our enquiries.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785511094
OL,3,CAppeal to find brutal murderer 40
OL,4,Cyears after crime
OL,6,F"In 1986 DNA was very much in the
OL,7,Fearly stages and as such was not
OL,8,Favailable to the detectives who
OL,9,Foriginally investigated Diane's death,
OL,10,Fbut her murder was fully investigated
OL,11,Fby the team."
OL,13,FShe continued: "We believe the DNA
OL,14,Fprofile will be key to finding the
OL,15,Fkiller and to date have eliminated 575
OL,16,Fpeople with 32 currently under review.
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@POU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,365,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F364A1785511094
OL,3,CAppeal to find brutal murderer 40
OL,4,Cyears after crime
OL,6,F"It is also possible that someone
OL,7,Fcould hold information about the
OL,8,Fidentity of Diane's killer but either
OL,9,Fthrough fear or a misplaced sense of
OL,10,Floyalty has not yet come forward.
OL,12,F"To those people I would say please
OL,13,Fhave the courage to tell us what you
OL,14,Fknow."
OL,16,FAnyone with information is urged to
OL,17,Fcontact Crimestoppers to help finally
OL,18,Fbring Diane's killer to justice.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUvD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/7
